{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Severely restrict press reports on UK defence capabilities ",
        "additional_details": "On 7 June 2026 The Mail on Sunday reported: \u201cEntire fleet of UK attack subs is unfit for war and stuck in dock.\u201d Sunday Express states \u201cLabour delays leave Britain weak\u2019 at time of war\u201d and on 6 June 2026 the Daily Mail reported that HMS Prince of Wales has \u201c\u2026broken down again\u201d and the Daily Mirror reported that the \u00a36.3 billion Ajax armoured vehicles are \u201c\u2026not fit for use\u201d in combat. We think these reports undermine our national defence.",
        "background": "We want the Government to place severe restrictions on the media reporting on the strength or weakness of our Army, the Royal Navy and Royal Air Force. We believe the public do not need to know this information know while our enemies do.",
